SUMMARY:Comic-Con | Day One - Comic-Con Ireland
DESCRIPTION:Our first day at Comic-Con Ireland! Time for cosplay,
 collectibles, gaming, science fiction, and everything else that makes
 conventions brilliant. No live stream, but keep an eye on our socials for
 photos and videos. The merchandise stalls are already worrying me. A
 special IRL trip to Comic-Con Ireland for a weekend celebrating movies,
 television, comics and pop culture. I'll be heading along to enjoy the
 convention and meet some incredible guests, including William Shatner,
 Elijah Wood, Sean Astin, Miranda Otto and Steve Guttenberg. There won't be
 a live stream from the event, but expect plenty of stories and memories
 from the trip!
