SUMMARY:Comic-Con | Day Two - Comic-Con Ireland
DESCRIPTION:We're back for another day of convention adventures! More
 costumes, more exploring, and probably more things we don't have room for
 in the suitcase. No regular Movie Night this Sunday, but I'll share
 updates whenever I can. A special IRL trip to Comic-Con Ireland for a
 weekend celebrating movies, television, comics and pop culture. I'll be
 heading along to enjoy the convention and meet some incredible guests,
 including William Shatner, Elijah Wood, Sean Astin, Miranda Otto and Steve
 Guttenberg. There won't be a live stream from the event, but expect plenty
 of stories and memories from the trip!
