SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 50 - Curse You, Concrete Pump! We
 Haven't Even Started Yet!
DESCRIPTION:It's Episode 50 of Construction Simulator, and the new bypass
 project is already threatening to turn into a disagreement with the
 concrete pump. We haven't even started properly, and the machinery is
 apparently preparing its objections. A promising start to another peaceful
 construction job. Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better than
 ever! Take charge of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to the
 franchise, and build to your heart's content on two huge maps - on your
 own or with your friends!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
