SUMMARY:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon | Ep. 2 - Cheshire,
 We Are NOT Keeping Whatever That Is
DESCRIPTION:Cereza and Cheshire return for another trip into the
 mysterious forest, with puzzles to solve and strange creatures to
 encounter. I'll be doing my best to keep us moving, while Cheshire
 continues treating every questionable discovery like something we should
 take home. A magical storybook adventure following a young Cereza, long
 before she became the legendary Bayonetta. Alongside her demon companion
 Cheshire, she explores an enchanted forest filled with puzzles, secrets,
 and dangerous creatures in a beautifully illustrated fantasy world.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
