SUMMARY:Nerina Pallot | Ep. 5 - Live
DESCRIPTION:Thursday is something different: Nerina Pallot live. We're
 trading our usual gaming chaos for an evening of music, with a special
 19:30-23:30 GMT slot in the schedule. No concrete pumps, sandworms, or
 Oblivion Gates required - at least that's the plan. A very special night
 as I head to Airdrie Town Hall to see my favourite artist, Nerina Pallot,
 performing live. I'm really looking forward to an evening of fantastic
 music and getting to experience one of my favourite artists in concert.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Nerina Pallot
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
