DTEND:20261127T233000Z
SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 26 - The Devil Don't Knock Before He
 Comes Calling
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan's journey continues, and after everything we've
 seen so far, I don't expect the frontier to suddenly become peaceful. Come
 along for Episode 26 as we find out where the next decisions take us -
 preferably with fewer problems than Dutch can create. Arthur Morgan and
 the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and
 bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight
 their way across the rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
