SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 91 - Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan (1982)
DESCRIPTION:We finish the week with Movie Night Episode 91 and Star Trek
 II: The Wrath of Khan (1982). Kirk and the Enterprise crew face an old
 adversary, while we settle in with snacks and the community. A proper
 science-fiction finale to the week. Meet you all on Discord for Movie
 Night.
