SUMMARY:Hitman: Codename 47 | Ep. 1
DESCRIPTION: Step into the polished shoes of Agent 47 as we return to
 where the legendary Hitman franchise began! In this classic stealth-action
 game from 2000, we'll take on dangerous contracts across the globe, using
 disguises, careful planning and a variety of weapons to complete our
 assignments. From the bustling streets of Hong Kong to the jungles of
 Colombia, we'll navigate challenging environments while gradually
 uncovering the mysterious origins of Agent 47 himself. Expect plenty of
 sneaking around, questionable disguises, unexpected complications and
 carefully laid plans that will probably go spectacularly wrong. Can we
 become the ultimate professional assassin, or will our attempts at stealth
 descend into complete chaos?
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Hitman: Codename 47
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
